{"title": "Tavern Brawler", "pageid": 8378, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Tavern_Brawler", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features", "Applies to Wild Shape"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tavern_Brawler.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Tavern_Brawler.webp/300px-Tavern_Brawler.webp, /w/images/0/0d/Tavern_Brawler.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Tavern_Brawler.webp/300px-Tavern_Brawler.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Tavern_Brawler.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Tavern Brawler</b> is a passive feature granted by the <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">feat</a> of the same name. It increases the accuracy and damage of <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Unarmed Strike\">Unarmed Strikes</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> attacks, and <a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\">Improvised Melee Weapon</a> attacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you make an unarmed attack, use an improvised weapon, or throw something, your Strength <a href=\"/wiki/Modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Modifier\">Modifier</a> is added to the damage and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> an additional time. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Tavern_Brawler_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tavern Brawler (Feat)\">Tavern Brawler (Feat)</a>\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This feat always adds the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/20px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/30px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/40px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Strength\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/20px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> modifier. For example, if an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Unarmed Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/30px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unarmed Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Unarmed Strike\">Unarmed Strike</a> is made with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png/20px-Dexterity_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png/30px-Dexterity_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png/40px-Dexterity_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dexterity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png/20px-Dexterity_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a>, both Dexterity and Strength modifiers will be added a single time.</li>\n<li>Druids in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/30px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/40px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Shape\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\">Wild Shape</a> receive the bonus, except when wild shaped as a <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape:_Fire_Myrmidon\" title=\"Wild Shape: Fire Myrmidon\">Fire</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape:_Water_Myrmidon\" title=\"Wild Shape: Water Myrmidon\">Water</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape:_Air_Myrmidon\" title=\"Wild Shape: Air Myrmidon\">Air Myrmidon</a>.</li>\n<li>Characters (and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/30px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/40px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Shape\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\">Wild Shape</a> forms) with negative Strength modifiers have their attack and damage rolls reduced an additional time by this feat.\n<ul><li>This does not apply to damage from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/30px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/40px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\">Improvised Melee Weapon</a> attacks,<sup id=\"cite_ref-Honour_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Honour-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> however, because Tavern Brawler adds a separate damage source which cannot deal less than 0 damage.</li></ul></li>\n<li>When a creature is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thrown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Thrown</a>, it takes extra damage from Tavern Brawler when it lands.<sup id=\"cite_ref-Honour_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Honour-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>This feat, especially in conjunction with high Strength, is considered to be one of the strongest in the game, as it significantly increases both the likelihood of a hit and the damage dealt.<sup id=\"cite_ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It also benefits from a number of synergies:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halfling_Luck\" title=\"Halfling Luck\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp/20px-Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp/30px-Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp/40px-Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Halfling Luck\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp/20px-Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling_Luck\" title=\"Halfling Luck\">Halfling Luck</a>, which significantly reduces the odds of a <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Critical_misses\" title=\"Dice rolls\">critical miss</a> when an attack roll would succeed on a 2 or higher, as Tavern Brawler enables. Normally, there is a 1 in 20 chance of a miss on such an attack, but for halflings there is only a 1 in 400 chance (or 1 in 160,000 with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>).</li>\n<li>When making a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> attack or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/30px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/40px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\">Improvised Melee Weapon</a> attack, the additional damage of Tavern Brawler is treated as a <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Mechanics#Damage_Riders_treated_as_Damage_Sources_(DRS)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Mechanics\">DRS</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-Honour_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Honour-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>As of Patch 8, bonus damage from this feat bypasses <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sturdy_(Condition)\" title=\"Sturdy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sturdy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sturdy_(Condition)\" title=\"Sturdy (Condition)\">Sturdy</a> and similar conditions when attacking with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-Honour_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Honour-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>As of Patch 8, this feat applies to the damage of several spells and effects while the caster is in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/30px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/40px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Shape\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\">Wild Shape</a>, including spells like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spike_Growth\" title=\"Spike Growth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Spike_Growth_Icon.webp/20px-Spike_Growth_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Spike_Growth_Icon.webp/30px-Spike_Growth_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Spike_Growth_Icon.webp/40px-Spike_Growth_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spike Growth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Spike_Growth_Icon.webp/20px-Spike_Growth_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Spike_Growth_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spike_Growth\" title=\"Spike Growth\">Spike Growth</a> and items like <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Spore_Grenade\" title=\"Noxious Spore Grenade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Spore_Grenade\" title=\"Noxious Spore Grenade\">Noxious Spore Grenades</a>. Wild Shapes with low <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/20px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/30px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/40px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Strength\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/20px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> have a penalty applied to the damage rolls of these spells and effects.\n<ul><li>Additional elemental damage from attacks while in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/30px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/40px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Shape\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\">Wild Shape</a>, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> damage from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Corrosive_Spit\" title=\"Corrosive Spit\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Corrosive_Spit_Icon.webp/20px-Corrosive_Spit_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Corrosive_Spit_Icon.webp/30px-Corrosive_Spit_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Corrosive_Spit_Icon.webp/40px-Corrosive_Spit_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Corrosive Spit\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Corrosive_Spit_Icon.webp/20px-Corrosive_Spit_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Corrosive_Spit_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Corrosive_Spit\" title=\"Corrosive Spit\">Corrosive Spit</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">Thunder</span></a> damage from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grounded_Thunder_Strike\" title=\"Grounded Thunder Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Generic_Thunder_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Thunder_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Generic_Thunder_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Thunder_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Generic_Thunder_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Thunder_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grounded Thunder Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Generic_Thunder_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Thunder_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Generic_Thunder_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grounded_Thunder_Strike\" title=\"Grounded Thunder Strike\">Grounded Thunder Strike</a>, will receive an additional damage bonus, even in Honour Mode.</li></ul></li>\n<li>The additional damage of Tavern Brawler applied to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> attacks, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/30px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/40px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\">Improvised Melee Weapon</a> attacks, and certain attacks in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/30px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/40px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Shape\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\">Wild Shape</a><sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"Could not replicate with ...\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup> has no damage type and therefore can never be resisted,<sup id=\"cite_ref-Honour_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Honour-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> even by an <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance\" title=\"Elixir of Universal Resistance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/ELX_Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/ELX_Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/ELX_Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/ELX_Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bb/ELX_Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance\" title=\"Elixir of Universal Resistance\">Elixir of Universal Resistance</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Warding_Bond\" title=\"Warding Bond\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/20px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/30px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/40px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Warding Bond\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/20px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Warding_Bond\" title=\"Warding Bond\">Warding Bond</a> (In this case, both the caster and target take full damage). Flat damage reduction effects still apply.</li>\n<li>In Honour Mode, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/30px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/40px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\">Improvised Melee Weapon</a> attacks do not receive extra damage from Tavern Brawler. They receive a bonus to attack rolls as expected.\n<ul><li>Although using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> on anything but <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/38px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/50px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thrown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a> weapons behaves similarly to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/30px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/40px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\">Improvised Melee Weapon</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> attacks always benefit from both the attack roll and damage benefits of Tavern Brawler. However, when throwing a creature in Honour Mode, the creature will not receive extra damage from Tavern Brawler when landing.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-Honour-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Honour_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Honour_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Honour_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Honour_1-3\">1.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Honour_1-4\">1.4</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Except in Honour Mode. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> This is arguably a significant deviation from the bounded accuracy principle<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>url 1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> of D&amp;D 5e, which aims to keep ACs, DCs, and roll modifiers within a certain range to ensure that the outcome of an action is determined by a d20 roll, rather than many flat modifiers stacked together. To put this feat's bonuses into better context, imagine the DM gives a player character the +10 damage from the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Great Weapon Master\">Great Weapon Master</a> Feat, but then <i>also</i> gives them a <i>+5</i> to attack rolls instead of the normal <i>-5</i>. </span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r345964\"><div class=\"reflist refs-url\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a